WEBVTT

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:11.809
Hi, friends. Hani here.

00:00:11.809 --> 00:00:20.380
This is the Reset. We use it when one thing ends, and the next thing is about to begin.

00:00:20.380 --> 00:00:26.094
Feet flat on the floor. Hands resting on your desk, or in your lap.

00:00:26.094 --> 00:00:32.760
Sit tall, like a tree. Let your shoulders drop down, away from your ears.

00:00:32.760 --> 00:00:36.569
Soften your jaw. Let your hands be still.

00:00:36.569 --> 00:00:43.236
Now breathe with me. In through your nose — two, three, four.

00:00:43.236 --> 00:00:48.949
Out slow — two, three, four, five, six.

00:00:48.949 --> 00:00:53.711
Again. In — two, three, four.

00:00:53.711 --> 00:00:59.425
Out slow — two, three, four, five, six.

00:00:59.425 --> 00:01:04.186
One more. In — two, three, four.

00:01:04.186 --> 00:01:09.900
Out slow — two, three, four, five, six.

00:01:09.900 --> 00:01:15.614
Notice your body now. Your shoulders. Your hands. Your breath.

00:01:15.614 --> 00:01:20.376
Quiet body. Quiet mind. Ready for what's next.

00:01:20.376 --> 00:01:22.280
Open your eyes.

00:01:22.280 --> 00:01:23.233
Ready to learn.
